message: If you use this formalization, please cite it as below. The paper of the
  same title is published on Hexagon as 2611.01171 (https://hexagonmath.org/abs/2611.01171),
  and the releases of this repository
  (https://github.com/macgregor-sudo/cartan-cubic-planes/releases) attach it as a PDF
  with its TeX source.
title: On the planes of Cartan's cubics and the missing seven — Lean 4 formalization
type: software
